# Normalize line endings -- the repo stores LF, checkout is native.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary

# Lockfiles: keep diffs collapsed in review, still merge textually
package-lock.json -diff
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
yarn.lock -diff

# Generated -- collapse in review
CHANGELOG.md -diff
schemas/*.json linguist-generated=true

# Machine-generated snapshot compared byte-for-byte against a fresh
# regeneration -- the api-contract baseline (.repo-contract, via
# internal-package-contract's own scripts/api-contract/baseline-store.ts,
# API-Extractor-backed under the hood) emits CRLF unconditionally, so git
# must leave its line endings untouched or every regeneration's hash check
# breaks (baseline.meta.json's apiJsonHash/dtsHash are computed against the
# CRLF bytes api-extractor actually wrote; `* text=auto eol=lf` above
# rewriting them to LF on checkout/commit corrupts that hash). Mirrors this
# path's existing .prettierignore / eslint ignore entries, and
# internal-package-contract's own repo-contract's identical override.
/.repo-contract/**  -text
